        <h3>One-Click Setup</h3>
        <p>Get a beautiful Nuvio home screen in seconds. Pick a style, download your collections JSON and import it into Nuvio — no config required.</p>
        <ul class="card-features" style="--dot:#ffb800;">
          <li style="color:var(--muted);">Pick a preset style</li>
          <li style="color:var(--muted);">Download your collections JSON</li>
          <li style="color:var(--muted);">Import into Nuvio — done</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5;">⚠️ You'll still need a stream source like AIOstream or Torrentio and a Debrid Provider like Torbox to play content. Don't have one? <span onclick="event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();window.open('https://torbox.app/subscription?referral=6045ea4f-37f9-4184-9ab8-b74bc9725ac8','_blank')" style="color:#ffb800;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;">Get TorBox — 3 months free →</span></p>
        <span class="card-cta" style="color:#ffb800;margin-top:12px;display:block;">Get Quick Setup →</span>
      </a>

